    "q-51810": {
      "dom_id": "step-q51810",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "${(\\frac{3wt}{8})}^{2}=$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we apply the power of quotient rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\frac{3wt}{8})}^{2}=\\frac{(3wt)^{2}}{{8}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the power of product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(3wt)^{2}}{{8}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{{3}^{2}{w}^{2}{t}^{2}}{{8}^{2}} & = \\\\ \\frac{9{w}^{2}{t}^{2}}{64}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
